==English==

===Etymology===
Germanic: from [[home]] + [[sickness]] (from [[sick]] + [[-ness]])

===Alternative forms===
* [[home-sickness]]

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|es}}

# The characteristic of being [[homesick]]; a strong, sad [[feeling]] of [[miss]]ing one's [[home]] (and often left-behind loved ones, such as [[family]] and [[friend]]s) when physically away.

====Derived terms====
* [[homesick]] (back-formation)

====See also====
* [[melancholy]]
* [[nostalgia]]

